import json,pathlib,html
p=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]/'dist';r=json.loads((p/'data/coverage.json').read_text());esc=html.escape
rows=''.join(f'<tr><th><a href="{n.lower()}.html">{n}</a></th>'+''.join(f'<td>{d[k]:,}</td>' for k in ['vocab','grammar','kanji'])+f"<td>{sum(e.get('curriculum_status')=='supplementary' for e in json.loads((p/f'data/{n.lower()}.json').read_text())['vocab']):,}</td></tr>" for n,d in r['counts'].items())
excluded=''.join('<tr><td>'+esc(e['text'])+'</td><td>'+esc(e['reading'])+'</td><td>'+e['level']+'</td><td>'+esc(e['reason'])+'</td></tr>' for e in r['vocabulary'] if e['status']=='excluded')
body=f'''<a class="back-link" href="lessons.html">← Lessons / পাঠ / पाठहरू</a><span class="eyebrow">N5 → N1</span><h1>Coverage & study resources</h1><section class="panel"><h2>যা যুক্ত হয়েছে · What is included · समावेश सामग्री</h2><p>Grammar, vocabulary, Kanji, search, flashcards, quizzes and pronunciation for all five levels.</p><div style="overflow:auto"><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Vocabulary</th><th>Grammar entries</th><th>Kanji</th><th>Extra vocabulary (included)</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows}</tbody></table></div><p>Counts are entries, including alternative grammar forms and readings; they are not a count of unique exam requirements. Level assignments can differ between community sources.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>কীভাবে মিলিয়েছি · Source audit · स्रोत जाँच</h2><p>Every OpenJLPT entry from N5–N1 is included. All 595 grammar records and 2,211 Kanji classifications from Japanese Language Data have a mapping in the audit. Of 8,293 vocabulary classifications, 8,272 map to dictionary entries and 21 remain excluded pending validation.</p><p>Vocabulary spellings, readings and applicable senses are checked against the bundled JMdict snapshot. Alternative spellings are searchable. Existing IDs are retained so saved lessons continue working.</p><p><a href="data/coverage.json">Full entry-by-entry coverage audit</a> · <a href="data/audit.json">Translation and totals audit</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT">OpenJLPT</a> · <a href="https://github.com/jkindrix/japanese-language-data">Japanese Language Data</a> · <a href="data/SUPPLEMENT-ATTRIBUTION.md">Attribution & licenses</a></p></section><section class="panel"><h2>সম্পূর্ণ official তালিকা নয় · Scope · दायरा</h2><p>JLPT সম্পূর্ণ vocabulary, Kanji ও grammar তালিকা প্রকাশ করে না। তাই পরীক্ষার কোনো কিছুই বাদ নেই—এমন নিশ্চয়তা দেওয়া সম্ভব নয়। এটি একাধিক কমিউনিটি উৎস মিলিয়ে তৈরি শিক্ষাসংগ্রহ।</p><p>JLPT does not publish an exhaustive vocabulary, Kanji or grammar specification. This collection cannot guarantee every possible exam item. Some source grammar is marked draft and still needs teacher review.</p><p>JLPT ले शब्दावली, कान्जी र व्याकरणको पूर्ण आधिकारिक सूची प्रकाशन गर्दैन। त्यसैले परीक्षामा आउन सक्ने सबै कुरा समेटिएको ग्यारेन्टी छैन।</p><p><a href="https://www.jlpt.jp/e/faq/">Official JLPT FAQ</a></p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Extended grammar & vocabulary</h2><p>Hanabira grammar has been cross-checked across N5–N1. Additional dictionary-validated vocabulary is supported by multiple frequency corpora or the Hanabira N3 index. Unclassified extra words are labeled and placed in the N1 reference collection; this placement is not a JLPT level claim.</p><p><a href="data/reference-audit.json">Extended entry-by-entry audit</a> · <a href="data/HANABIRA-ATTRIBUTION.md">Hanabira credit and license</a> · <a href="https://hanabira.org">hanabira.org</a></p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Reading & listening practice</h2><p>এই app-এর Listen pronunciation এবং flashcard সম্পূর্ণ listening বা reading mock test নয়। পরীক্ষার প্রশ্নের ধরন অনুশীলনে নিচের official resources ব্যবহার করুন।</p><p>Use the official samples for reading, listening and test-item formats. These resources open the JLPT website; copyrighted test questions are not copied here.</p><p><a class="chip" href="https://www.jlpt.jp/e/samples/forlearners.html">N5–N1 official samples ↗</a> <a class="chip" href="https://www.jlpt.jp/e/samples/sampleindex.html">Official practice workbooks ↗</a></p></section><section class="panel"><h2>অনুবাদের অবস্থা · Translations · अनुवाद</h2><p>English source text is available in every entry. Bengali and Nepali grammar glosses include authored translations; vocabulary, Kanji and examples include labeled automatic drafts. Drafts can contain errors and need native-speaker review. They are not certified translations.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Validation queue: 21 vocabulary records</h2><p>These source records were not added as standalone words because their dictionary identity or reading did not validate. Some are already present under another reading or as Kanji.</p><div style="overflow:auto"><table><thead><tr><th>Source form</th><th>Reading</th><th>Level</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody>{excluded}</tbody></table></div></section>'''
(p/'coverage.html').write_text('<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Coverage & resources · Nihongo Path</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><style>main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:24px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{text-align:left;padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4da}.panel{margin-bottom:24px}</style><main>'+body+'</main></html>')
